Canada, Finland, the Netherlands, Sweden, New Zealand, and Australia. These countries offer a range of activities, such as exploring nature, enjoying cultural experiences, and participating in sports and outdoor recreation. Additionally, they provide opportunities for personal fulfillment and well-being, such as access to education, healthcare, and other resources.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":60},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":60,\"byte_end\":102},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":102,\"byte_end\":169},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":169,\"byte_end\":673},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":673,\"byte_end\":1071},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1071,\"byte_end\":1211},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1211,\"byte_end\":1382},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1382,\"byte_end\":1515},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1515,\"byte_end\":1564},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1564,\"byte_end\":1576},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1576,\"byte_end\":1631},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1631,\"byte_end\":1801},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1801,\"byte_end\":1962},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1962,\"byte_end\":2049},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":2049,\"byte_end\":2065},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2065,\"byte_end\":2205},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2205,\"byte_end\":2370},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":2370,\"byte_end\":2471},{\"index\":18,\"byte_start\":2471,\"byte_end\":2534},{\"index\":19,\"byte_start\":2534,\"byte_end\":2574},{\"index\":20,\"byte_start\":2574,\"byte_end\":2772},{\"index\":21,\"byte_start\":2772,\"byte_end\":2871},{\"index\":22,\"byte_start\":2871,\"byte_end\":2905},{\"index\":23,\"byte_start\":2905,\"byte_end\":2995},{\"index\":24,\"byte_start\":2995,\"byte_end\":3007},{\"index\":25,\"byte_start\":3007,\"byte_end\":3152},{\"index\":26,\"byte_start\":3152,\"byte_end\":3298},{\"index\":27,\"byte_start\":3298,\"byte_end\":3468},{\"index\":28,\"byte_start\":3468,\"byte_end\":3525},{\"index\":29,\"byte_start\":3525,\"byte_end\":3670},{\"index\":30,\"byte_start\":3670,\"byte_e