keOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":2.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Nightlife, Restaurants, Bars, Dive Bars, Cocktail Bars, Burgers, Mexican\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"11:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:0-14:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"10:0-22:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"16:0-2:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"16:0-2:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Boondocks\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2016-02-14 23:33:30\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Looks like an attempt to class up the grimy Creekside a bit, but the space hasn't gotten much nicer. The food isn't very good, the drink options are in the C range, and the dive bar charm is largely gone. I'm not sure who the target audience is, but it seems like they don't know either.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2016-02-10 23:31:21\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Doors are closed! Al Rojas (the owner) apparently didn't even have the class to inform the employees, just locked the doors and left. He owns Alcazar and Milk and Honey in town also. My wife and I have lived here all our lives (54 & 53 yrs.) and that's not Santa Barbara style business practice. Not deserving of getting local business in the other locations.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2016-01-14 20:16:33\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"This place has a decent feel and the food is really good. The staff was generally pretty decent save for the slovenly bartender who was a least 3 times drunker than any of the paying customers and the other bartender who ordered food off of my tab and proceeded to share it with the entire bar without my permission. The portion of my food that I was able to eat was very good though. I would not take anyone here who I was trying to impress but this is really not a bad place to relax and enjoy some Santa Barbara overpriced drinks.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Boondocks is a nightlife spot located in Santa Barbara, CA, offering a variety of food and drink options. According to customer reviews, the atmosphere is relaxed and casual, with outdoor seating available. The menu includes burgers and Mexican cuisine, and the drink selection ranges from cocktails to beer. However, reviews suggest that the quality of food and drinks is inconsistent, with some patrons expressing disappointment in their dining experience. Additionally, there have been complaints about the service, including slow and unfriendly bartenders. Despite these issues, Boondocks still maintains a 2.5-star rating and appears to be a popular spot for locals.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":681},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":681,\"byte_end\":785},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":785,\"byte_end\":959},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":959,\"byte_end\":1075},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1075,\"byte_end\":1124},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1124,\"byte_end\":1183},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1183,\"byte_end\":1237},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1237,\"byte_end\":1432},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1432,\"byte_end\":1691},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1691,\"byte_end\":1759},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1759,\"byte_end\":1924}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":106},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":106,\"byte_end\":207},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":207,\"byte_end\":309},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":309,\"byte_end\":459},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":459,\"byte_end\":561},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":561,\"byte_end\":671}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
