eccable. The bar offers free WiFi and has outdoor seating available. It is also suitable for groups and features music.\\n\\nIn terms of amenities, The Sportsman provides various parking options, including garage and street parking. However, valet and lot parking are not available. The establishment has received positive reviews for its clean and friendly environment. Notably, the bar is renowned for its homemade Bloody Marys, which are made from scratch, without any premix.\\n\\nOverall, The Sportsman is a highly regarded local bar in Santa Barbara, known for its excellent service, cozy atmosphere, and impressive drink offerings.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":820},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":820,\"byte_end\":909},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":909,\"byte_end\":1004},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1004,\"byte_end\":1070},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1070,\"byte_end\":1281},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1281,\"byte_end\":1478},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1478,\"byte_end\":1587},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1587,\"byte_end\":1845},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1845,\"byte_end\":1973},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1973,\"byte_end\":2068},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":2068,\"byte_end\":2161},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":2161,\"byte_end\":2258},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":2258,\"byte_end\":2548},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":2548,\"byte_end\":2564},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":2564,\"byte_end\":2629},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2629,\"byte_end\":2657},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2657,\"byte_end\":2702}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":76},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":76,\"byte_end\":174},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":174,\"byte_end\":268},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":268,\"byte_end\":437},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":437,\"byte_end\":556},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":556,\"byte_end\":616},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":616,\"byte_end\":668},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":668,\"byte_en