ate \\\"mountains and valleys\\\" in the ribbon. While holding the center crease, place the plastic zip tie around the center and close it halfway. (Passage 2)\\n3. Be careful not to get glue all over the ribbon when creating the center tie. Use a small piece of ribbon to create the center tie, and hot glue one end to the hair band area. Wrap the ribbon around and hot glue the other end on top of the ribbon. Make sure not to use too much glue, as it may ooze out and look bad. (Passage 3)\\n\\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":111},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":111,\"byte_end\":135},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":135,\"byte_end\":204},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":204,\"byte_end\":236},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":236,\"byte_end\":402},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":402,\"byte_end\":534},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":534,\"byte_end\":695},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":695,\"byte_end\":773},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":773,\"byte_end\":885},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":885,\"byte_end\":955},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":955,\"byte_end\":1044}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":162},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":162,\"byte_end\":266},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":266,\"byte_end\":363},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":363,\"byte_end\":466},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":466,\"byte_end\":594},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":594,\"byte_end\":693},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":693,\"byte_end\":785},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":785,\"byte_end\":883},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":883,\"byte_end\":955},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":955,\"byte_end\":1024},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1024,\"byte_end\":1056},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1056,\"byte_end\":1102}]}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
