2.20.839.205 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"432 E Haley St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":null,\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Organic Stores, Breakfast & Brunch, Live/Raw Food, Juice Bars & Smoothies, Food, Restaurants\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"7:30-17:30\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"7:30-17:30\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"9:0-16:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"7:30-17:30\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"7:30-17:30\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"7:30-17:30\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"AH Juice Organics\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2022-01-08 21:58:19\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Caution! friendly and good food but...  No one is masked or rubber gloved preparing or serving food. And this is at the height of the pandemic \\\\\\\"viral blizzard\\\\\\\".  I asked how they could do that, not follow guidelines at this time. The young man said \\\\\\\"we just stay healthy\\\\\\\".  Uh, don't you understand symptomless transmission?  Don't you know you can easily infect others? You are serving food! You are fine to say it's OK to walk around outside firing a loaded gun. \\\\n\\\\nHesitatingly paid my to-go order and won't be back.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-25 17:42:47\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"We stopped here for organic coffee but wow they have a lot of items! We will be back to try more stuff!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-17 22:14:34\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I've been to Ah Juice a few times in the past and enjoyed my food. I was very disappointed to see that this business is not using masks despite a current public health order requiring masks. No staff members were masked and there was no attempt to require masks of customers who were standing in line indoors. It's one thing to decide not to wear a mask when visiting friends, but it's totally different when you are operating a business dealing with the public. Do they also think it's not necessary to follow public health requirements that restaurant employees wash their hands after going to the bathroom or handling raw meat? For a place that supposedly serves healthy food, they have sent a clear message that their preferences are more important than their customers' and employees' health. I won't be returning.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"AH Juice Organics is a local business located at 432 E Haley St in Santa Barbara, CA. It is a popular spot known for its organic products, including breakfast and brunch options, live/raw food, juice bars, and smoothies. The business operates from 7:30 AM to 5:30 PM on weekdays and from 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM on Saturdays.\\n\\nCustomers have left mixed reviews about AH Juice Organics. One customer expressed concern about the lack of COVID-19 safety measures, mentioning that the staff did not wear masks or gloves while preparing or serving food. This raised questions about following guidelines and the potential for symptomless transmission. Another customer was disappointed to see that the business did not enforce mask usage among staff and customers, despite a public health order requiring masks. This customer felt that the business prioritized its preferences over the health and safety of its customers and employees.\\n\\nOn the other hand, a different customer had a positive experience and appreciated the wide variety of items available, specifically mentioning the organic coffee.\\n\\nOverall, AH Juice Organics has received a rating of 3.5 stars. While some customers have enjoyed their food and found the business to be friendly, others have raised concerns about the lack of COVID-19 safety measures.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":712},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":712,\"byte_end\":743},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":743,\"byte_end\":804},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":804,\"byte_end\":867},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":867,\"byte_end\":935},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":935,\"byte_end\":981},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":981,\"byte_end\":1033},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1033,\"byte_end\":1078},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1078,\"byte_end\":1100},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1100,\"byte_end\":1172},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1172,\"byte_end\":1370},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1370,\"byte_end\":1545},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1545,\"byte_end\":1669},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1669,\"byte_end\":1788},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1788,\"byte_end\":1941},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1941,\"byte_end\":2109},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2109,\"byte_end\":2276},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":2276,\"byte_end\":2314}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":86},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":86,\"byte_end\":221},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":221,\"byte_end\":322},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":322,\"byte_end\":381},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":381,\"byte_end\":544},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":544,\"byte_end\":641},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":641,\"byte_end\":801},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":801,\"byte_end\":926},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":926,\"byte_end\":1090},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1090,\"byte_end\":1153},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1153,\"byte_end\":1308}]}"}], "temperature": 0, "seed": 70781, "max_to