ed that the food is of high quality and delicious. One customer mentioned that it was the best hot dog they have had in a long time. Another customer appreciated the owner, Dave, for his dedication in bringing great food to the community. \\n\\nThe restaurant offers outdoor seating and takeout options. It is suitable for groups and has a casual and trendy ambience. The business does not provide WiFi. \\n\\nDave's Dogs operates from 11:00 AM to 8:00 PM from Monday to Thursday, and from 11:00 AM to 9:00 PM on Fridays and Saturdays. The parking options include street parking and a parking lot. \\n\\nOverall, Dave's Dogs is a highly recommended local business in Santa Barbara, known for its friendly staff, delicious hot dogs, and a variety of menu options.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":768},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":768,\"byte_end\":834},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":834,\"byte_end\":1013},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1013,\"byte_end\":1066},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1066,\"byte_end\":1234},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1234,\"byte_end\":1298},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1298,\"byte_end\":1367},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1367,\"byte_end\":1467},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1467,\"byte_end\":1519}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":81},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":81,\"byte_end\":138},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":138,\"byte_end\":236},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":236,\"byte_end\":312},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":312,\"byte_end\":385},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":385,\"byte_end\":467},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":467,\"byte_end\":575},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":575,\"byte_end\":634},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":634,\"byte_end\":698},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":698,\"byte_end\":736},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":736,\"byte_end\":862},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":862,\"byte_end\":926},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":926,\"byte_end\":1084}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n