et mignon. There is also a salad bar available. Customers have praised the quality of the steak and the freshness of the salad bar.\\n\\nThe service at The Palms has been highly regarded by customers. The staff, particularly Trish, has been commended for being friendly, attentive, and going above and beyond to ensure a wonderful dining experience. One customer mentioned that Trish even brought them a delicious piece of cheesecake to celebrate a special occasion.\\n\\nThe atmosphere at The Palms is described as casual and classy, making it suitable for various occasions such as dates, family dinners, and celebrations. However, it should be noted that the business does not offer outdoor seating or WiFi.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":840},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":840,\"byte_end\":846},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":846,\"byte_end\":861},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":861,\"byte_end\":875},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":875,\"byte_end\":885},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":885,\"byte_end\":909},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":909,\"byte_end\":919},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":919,\"byte_end\":1058},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1058,\"byte_end\":1176},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1176,\"byte_end\":1240},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1240,\"byte_end\":1362},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1362,\"byte_end\":1403},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1403,\"byte_end\":1447},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1447,\"byte_end\":1545},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1545,\"byte_end\":1609},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":1609,\"byte_end\":1672},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":1672,\"byte_end\":1716},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":1716,\"byte_end\":1808},{\"index\":18,\"byte_start\":1808,\"byte_end\":1957},{\"index\":19,\"byte_start\":1957,\"byte_end\":2015},{\"index\":20,\"byte_start\":2015,\"byte_end\":2065},{\"index\":21,\"byte_start\":2065,\"byte_end\":2101},{\"index\":22,\"byte_start\":2101,\"byte_end\":2377},{\"index\":23,\"byte_start\":2377,\"byte_end\":2489},{\"index\":24,\"byte_