top_p","min_p","xtc","temperature"],"speculative.types":"none","timings_per_token":false,"post_sampling_probs":false,"backend_sampling":false,"lora":[]},"next_token":[{"has_next_token":false,"has_new_line":false,"n_remain":147,"n_decoded":109}],"prompt":"<|im_start|>user\n{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"431 State St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Restaurants, Indian, Pakistani\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"11:30-23:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"11:30-22:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:30-23:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"11:30-22:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:30-22:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:30-22:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:30-22:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"All India Cafe\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2014-07-08 12:54:18\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"We used to eat here all the time, as they had the best (albeit not excellent) Indian food in Santa Barbara.  Late last year there was change of ownership and the food completely changed.  All the sauces are different, and they are all pretty bad now.  I used to get their Vindaloo, but now it is inedible.  Unfortunately, there are no more Indian food restaurants in all of Santa Barbara worth going to.  The only local Indian food worth a damn is in Goleta next to KFC.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2014-05-09 12:39:12\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Good food (they'll assume you want it mild, if you're a spicy fan, ask). Great service. \\\\n\\\\nSamosa, lamb curry, cauliflower and spinach curry all well done.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2014-05-05 04:17:54\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"We stopped by on our way back to LA. It doesn't look like much from outside, but we loved the food. My husband and I are vegan and they were very accommodating. Someone next to us left a jacket and the server ran down the street to get it back to her. Just a nice atmosphere and vegan friendly.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Sure! Here's an objective overview of All India Cafe based on the provided structured data:\\n\\nAll India Cafe is a restaurant located in Santa Barbara, California that serves Indian and Pakistani cuisine. According to their Yelp profile, they have a rating of 3.0 out of 5 stars based on 3 reviews. The restaurant is open Monday through Sunday from 11:30am to 10:00pm, with a break from 2:00pm to 5:00pm on Tuesdays. They offer takeout and reservations, but do not have outdoor seating or WiFi. The ambiance is casual and there is no music or live entertainment.\\n\\nThe menu features a variety of dishes, including appetizers, soups, salads, and entrees such as chicken tikka masala, beef madras, and vegetable korma. They also offer a lunch special and a buffet on weekends.\\n\\nAccording to recent reviews, the quality of the food at All India Cafe has been inconsistent. One reviewer praised the service and the quality of the food, while another reviewer found the sauces to be different and not as good as before. Another reviewer mentioned that the restaurant is not as good as it used to be and that there are no other Indian food restaurants in Santa Barbara worth visiting. However, one reviewer did mention that the food is still good, particularly the samosa, lamb curry, and cauliflower and spinach curry.\\n\\nOverall, All India Cafe appears to be a casual Indian and Pakistani restaurant with a varied menu and good service. However, the quality of the food may be inconsistent, and some reviewers have reported a decline in quality since a change of ownership.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":906},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":906,\"byte_end\":985},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":985,\"byte_end\":1049},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1049,\"byte_end\":1104},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1104,\"byte_end\":1202},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1202,\"byte_end\":1414},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1414,\"byte_end\":1429},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1429,\"byte_end\":1608},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1608,\"byte_end\":1671},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1671,\"byte_end\":1732},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1732,\"byte_end\":1823},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1823,\"byte_end\":1882}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":6},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":6,\"byte_end\":203},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":203,\"byte_end\":297},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":297,\"byte_end\":415},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":415,\"byte_end\":493},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":493,\"byte_end\":562},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":562,\"byte_end\":714},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":714,\"byte_end\":773},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":773,\"byte_end\":867},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":867,\"byte_end\":1012},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1012,\"byte_end\":1176},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1176,\"byte_end\":1312},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1312,\"byte_end\":1428},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1428,\"byte_end\":1564}]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
