 as dried up and barren, comparing it to a movie set or a fake grocery store in North Korea. The customer advised others not to waste their time at Nona's and questioned the authenticity of an Italian deli selling top ramen.\\n\\nOverall, Nona's Italian Deli has received a 3.0-star rating, indicating a mixed customer experience. It is known for its affordability and classic Italian subs, although some customers have raised concerns about sanitation and the overall ambiance of the deli.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":860},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":860,\"byte_end\":1050},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":1050,\"byte_end\":1060},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":1060,\"byte_end\":1077},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1077,\"byte_end\":1165},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1165,\"byte_end\":1246},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1246,\"byte_end\":1292},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1292,\"byte_end\":1370},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1370,\"byte_end\":1431},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1431,\"byte_end\":1511},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1511,\"byte_end\":1769},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1769,\"byte_end\":1790},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1790,\"byte_end\":1873},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1873,\"byte_end\":1906},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1906,\"byte_end\":2041},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2041,\"byte_end\":2143},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2143,\"byte_end\":2172},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":2172,\"byte_end\":2230}],\"answer_sentence_indices\":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"answer_offsets\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":95},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":95,\"byte_end\":236},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":236,\"byte_end\":374},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":374,\"byte_end\":430},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":430,\"byte_end\":554},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":554,\"byte_end\":683},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":683,\"byte_end\":762},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":762,\"byte_end\":903},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":903,\"byte_end\":977},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":977,\"