3.45.320.460 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "{\"instruction\":\"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.\",\"source\":\"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"221 Stearns Wharf\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":false,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":true,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":true},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Restaurants, Fish & Chips, Food, Seafood, American (Traditional), Fast Food, Coffee & Tea, Breakfast & Brunch\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"7:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"7:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"7:0-19:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"7:0-19:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"7:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"7:0-17:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"7:0-17:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Char West\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-26 04:52:35\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"It was the worst fish n chips I've ever had. I believe the fish was tilapia as it tasted muddy. We felt disgusted after eating there. The same type of fish was used in the fish taco. We were hungry and was super disappointed with the meal. If you want to eat muddy tasty fish, you can give it a try. It's worst than the frozen fish from the grocery store.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-09 18:16:50\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Nice stop on the pier for coffee\\\\n\\\\nThis is a no frills, no fuss, coffee shop (but also serves  food?!) right on the edge of the pier.  It looks like they are not getting extremely high marks for food, but if you go into the place it doesn't feel like a spot for a gourmet meal. What it is great for, and why I'm giving it four stars, is because of the beautiful view over the pier.  It has some awesome seating on the rail, right outside. I suggest going there early in the morning, maybe even for sunrise, and getting a coffee. I also grabbed a bagel, toasted with cream cheese. It felt like a Bagel experience you would have at Starbucks or coffee bean. \\\\n\\\\nStop in for the coffee and the views!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-17 17:55:00\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Absolutely my favorite spot for breakfast in Santa Barbara! Casual outdoor dining area on Stearns wharf with absolutely gorgeous view of the ocean and the hills of Santa Barbara. Francisco, Blanca and the rest of the staff are always friendly and offer excellent service. They serve a range of espresso drinks, and a nice breakfast (and lunch) menu. My personal favorite is the huevos rancheros.  A great place to eat and appreciate the beauty of Santa Barbara.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\",\"answer\":\"Char West is a local business located at 221 Stearns Wharf in Santa Barbara, CA. It falls under the categories of Restaurants, Fish & Chips, Food, Seafood, American (Traditional), Fast Food, Coffee & Tea, and Breakfast & Brunch. The business operates from 7:0 AM to 5:0 PM from Monday to Thursday, and from 7:0 AM to 7:0 PM on Friday, Saturday, and Sunday.\\n\\nCustomers have left mixed reviews about Char West. One customer had a negative experience, describing the fish and chips as the worst they've ever had. They mentioned that the fish tasted muddy and left them feeling disgusted. Another customer, however, had a more positive experience, highlighting the coffee and the beautiful view over the pier. They recommended visiting early in the morning for a coffee and enjoying the seating on the rail.\\n\\nThe business has outdoor seating and offers takeout services. They also accept reservations and have validated parking available. However, their overall rating is 3.0 stars.\\n\\nChar West is known for its casual outdoor dining area with a gorgeous view of the ocean and the hills of Santa Barbara. The staff, including Francisco and Blanca, are friendly and provide excellent service. They serve a range of espresso drinks and have a breakfast and lunch menu available, with the huevos rancheros being a personal favorite.\\n\\nIn conclusion, Char West offers a mix of seafood, fast food, and breakfast options in a casual outdoor setting with scenic views. The quality of their fish and chips seems to vary, but they excel in providing a pleasant coffee experience with a beautiful atmosphere.\",\"source_segments\":[{\"index\":0,\"byte_start\":0,\"byte_end\":907},{\"index\":1,\"byte_start\":907,\"byte_end\":958},{\"index\":2,\"byte_start\":958,\"byte_end\":996},{\"index\":3,\"byte_start\":996,\"byte_end\":1045},{\"index\":4,\"byte_start\":1045,\"byte_end\":1102},{\"index\":5,\"byte_start\":1102,\"byte_end\":1162},{\"index\":6,\"byte_start\":1162,\"byte_end\":1395},{\"index\":7,\"byte_start\":1395,\"byte_end\":1427},{\"index\":8,\"byte_start\":1427,\"byte_end\":1570},{\"index\":9,\"byte_start\":1570,\"byte_end\":1675},{\"index\":10,\"byte_start\":1675,\"byte_end\":1731},{\"index\":11,\"byte_start\":1731,\"byte_end\":1821},{\"index\":12,\"byte_start\":1821,\"byte_end\":1872},{\"index\":13,\"byte_start\":1872,\"byte_end\":1948},{\"index\":14,\"byte_start\":1948,\"byte_end\":2123},{\"index\":15,\"byte_start\":2123,\"byte_end\":2242},{\"index\":16,\"byte_start\":2242,\"byte_end\":2335},{\"index\":17,\"byte_start\":2335,\"byte_end\":2413},{\"index\":18,\"byte_start\":2413,\"byte_end\":2460},{\"index\":19,\"byte_start\":2460,\"byte_end\":2541}],\"answer_sentence_indices\